      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Chat with streaming and memory\nChoose a model labeled (Tools), save the workflow, then open the n8n test chat. Send: My project codename is ORCHID. In the SAME chat, ask: What is my project codename? Expect ORCHID and incremental replies. New chat sessions have separate memory; memory is for local testing. Calculator is available for a tool-call check.\n\nFor local dev only. Set your credential and model on every Cortecs node. Real requests may incur charges.",
